@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5205

# Sample test scenarios (section 3G). Run top to bottom on a fresh database.
# Visual Studio syntax: '# @name x' + {{x.response.body.$.id}}. VS Code REST Client users: replace with {{x.response.body.id}}.

### Case 01 - Valid Competitor, partly paid (201)
# @name case01
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantName": "Juan Dela Cruz",
  "contactNumber": "09171234567",
  "email": "juan.delacruz@example.com",
  "address": "123 Rizal St., Naga City",
  "carMakeModel": "Toyota Supra MK4",
  "plateNumber": "TST 1001",
  "registrationType": "Competitor",
  "amountPaid": 1000.0
}

### Case 02 - Valid Exhibitor, not paid (201)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/registrations
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantName": "Juan Dela Cruz",
